<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Questar Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Questar Corp raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch upgraded Questar Corp to intermediate-term buy from accumulate, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Questar remains one of the firm's &quot;favorite gas stocks,&quot; the market source said.</p>
<p>-- Merrill expects earnings to grow at eight to 10 percent, the market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Questar gained 1-3/8 to 41-3/8.</p>
</text>
